// Test: Underscores of numeric literals
// Spec: 01-LEXICAL.md § 2.1 Numeric Separators
// Priority: P0 - Bootstrap Critical
//
// Purpose:
// Validate underscores of numbers each readability.
//
// Expected behavior:
// Should print 1000000 (1_000_000)

rite main() {
    ≔ x: !i32 = 1_000_000;
    println(x);
}
